{"id":"8001406763082","handle":"gathered-chiffon-sleeveless-bridesmaid-dress-ms02566","title":"ever ANIKA|Gathered Chiffon Sleeveless Bridesmaid Dress","descriptionHtml":"<p>This one-shoulder chiffon gown combines modern elegance with a timeless silhouette, making it a standout choice for weddings, evening galas, and formal parties. The asymmetric neckline highlights the shoulders and collarbone, while the soft ruching at the waist creates a slimming effect and enhances natural curves. A daring thigh-high slit adds movement and allure, making it easy to dance and walk with confidence.</p>\n<p>Crafted in lightweight chiffon, this dress flows beautifully with every step, balancing drama with sophistication. The fitted bodice transitions into an A-line skirt that elongates the figure, flattering a wide range of body shapes. Whether worn as a wedding guest dress, bridesmaid gown, or prom dress, this style effortlessly turns heads.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Fit</b>: Please refer to size chart.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Length</b>: Floor-length.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Sleeve Style</b>: Sleeveless.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Closure</b>: Side left zipper.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Undergarments</b>: It is padded, with lining.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Fabric</b>:The garment comprises chiffon.</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><b>Stretch</b>: Fabric is non-stretch.</p>\n<p><br /></p>","type":"Bridesmaid Dresses","tags":["A-Line","Ankle-Length","Asymmetrical","Bridesmaid Dresses","Chiffon Dresses","Dresses","Fall","Gathered","Green","MTO NEW","One Shoulder Dresses","Sleeveless","Spring","Summer","Trending"],"sourceUrl":"https://www.ever-pretty.com/products/gathered-chiffon-sleeveless-bridesmaid-dress-ms02566","capturedAt":"2026-09-30T00:40:42.944Z","price":{"amount":96.99,"currency":"USD"},"compareAtPrice":null,"available":true,"options":["Color","Size"],"variants":[{"id":"42497600094282","sku":"MS02566BD04","color":"Burgundy","size":"4","options":["Burgundy","4"],"price":{"amount":9